{"id": "budget-independent-001", "category": "body-fields", "group_id": "new-body-fields", "question": "在 Pydantic 模型内部声明字段校验时，Field 应从哪里导入，和 Query 的导入位置相同吗？", "reference_answer": "Field 从 pydantic 导入，Query 等从 fastapi 导入，二者导入位置不同。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.117.1"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-fields.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-fields.md", "quote": "注意，与从 `fastapi` 导入 `Query`，`Path`、`Body` 不同，要直接从 `pydantic` 导入 `Field` 。", "start_char": 752, "end_char": 824}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
{"id": "budget-independent-002", "category": "body-fields", "group_id": "new-body-fields", "question": "用 Field 或 Body 声明的附加元数据只供 Python 编辑器使用，还是也进入 JSON Schema？", "reference_answer": "Field、Query、Body 中声明的附加信息也会集成进 JSON Schema。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.117.1"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-fields.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-fields.md", "quote": "`Field`、`Query`、`Body` 等对象里可以声明更多信息，并且 JSON Schema 中也会集成这些信息。", "start_char": 1860, "end_char": 1921}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
{"id": "budget-independent-003", "category": "body-nested", "group_id": "new-body-nested", "question": "模型中的标签字段使用 set 而不是 list 后，输入和输出里的重复标签如何处理？", "reference_answer": "收到的重复标签会转换为唯一项集合；输出也只保留唯一项。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.117.1"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-nested-models.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-nested-models.md", "quote": "这样，即使你收到带有重复数据的请求，这些数据也会被转换为一组唯一项。", "start_char": 2257, "end_char": 2291}, {"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-nested-models.md", "quote": "而且，每当你输出该数据时，即使源数据有重复，它们也将作为一组唯一项输出。", "start_char": 2293, "end_char": 2329}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
{"id": "budget-independent-004", "category": "body-nested", "group_id": "new-body-nested", "question": "请求 JSON 的对象键只能是字符串，还能在接口中得到 int 键、float 值的 weights 字典吗？", "reference_answer": "可以将参数声明为 dict[int, float]；可转换的字符串键经 Pydantic 转换和校验后成为 int，值为 float。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.117.1"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-nested-models.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-nested-models.md", "quote": "async def create_index_weights(weights: dict[int, float]):", "start_char": 7317, "end_char": 7375}, {"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-nested-models.md", "quote": "请记住 JSON 仅支持将 `str` 作为键。", "start_char": 7409, "end_char": 7433}, {"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-nested-models.md", "quote": "这意味着，即使你的 API 客户端只能将字符串作为键发送，只要这些字符串内容仅包含整数，Pydantic 就会对其进行转换并校验。", "start_char": 7461, "end_char": 7526}, {"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/body-nested-models.md", "quote": "然后你接收的名为 `weights` 的 `dict` 实际上将具有 `int` 类型的键和 `float` 类型的值。", "start_char": 7528, "end_char": 7588}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
{"id": "budget-independent-005", "category": "body-multiple", "group_id": "new-body-multiple", "question": "接口已有两个模型请求体参数，还要把单一整数 importance 放在同一请求体中，应如何声明？", "reference_answer": "单一值默认会作为查询参数，应使用 Body，例如 importance: Annotated[int, Body()]。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.118.0"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.118.0/tutorial/body-multiple-params.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.118.0/tutorial/body-multiple-params.md", "quote": "如果你就按原样声明它，因为它是一个单一值，**FastAPI** 将假定它是一个查询参数。", "start_char": 2190, "end_char": 2235}, {"source": "fastapi/0.118.0/tutorial/body-multiple-params.md", "quote": "但是你可以使用 `Body` 指示 **FastAPI** 将其作为请求体的另一个键进行处理。", "start_char": 2237, "end_char": 2284}, {"source": "fastapi/0.118.0/tutorial/body-multiple-params.md", "quote": "item_id: int, item: Item, user: User, importance: Annotated[int, Body()]", "start_char": 2663, "end_char": 2735}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
{"id": "budget-independent-006", "category": "body-multiple", "group_id": "new-body-multiple", "question": "只有一个 Item 模型参数，也想让请求体最外层有 item 键，应该启用哪个 Body 参数？", "reference_answer": "设置 Body(embed=True)，使模型内容嵌入请求体的 item 键下。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.118.0"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.118.0/tutorial/body-multiple-params.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.118.0/tutorial/body-multiple-params.md", "quote": "但是，如果你希望它期望一个拥有 `item` 键并在值中包含模型内容的 JSON，就像在声明额外的请求体参数时所做的那样，则可以使用一个特殊的 `Body` 参数 `embed`：\n\n```Python\nitem: Item = Body(embed=True)\n```", "start_char": 4114, "end_char": 4249}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
{"id": "budget-independent-007", "category": "bigger-applications", "group_id": "new-bigger-applications", "question": "同一个 APIRouter 能否在同一应用分别放到 /api/v1 和 /api/latest 两个前缀下？", "reference_answer": "可以多次调用 include_router，分别提供不同 prefix。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.117.1"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/bigger-applications.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/bigger-applications.md", "quote": "你也可以在*同一*路由器上使用不同的前缀来多次使用 `.include_router()`。", "start_char": 18001, "end_char": 18047}, {"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/bigger-applications.md", "quote": "在有些场景这可能有用，例如以不同的前缀公开同一个的 API，比方说 `/api/v1` 和 `/api/latest`。", "start_char": 18049, "end_char": 18109}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
{"id": "budget-independent-008", "category": "bigger-applications", "group_id": "new-bigger-applications", "question": "要把一个 APIRouter 包含进另一个 APIRouter，是否需要在外层路由器加入应用之前完成？", "reference_answer": "是，先将子路由器 include 到外层路由器，再将外层路由器 include 到 FastAPI 应用。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.117.1"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/bigger-applications.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/tutorial/bigger-applications.md", "quote": "请确保在你将 `router` 包含到 `FastAPI` 应用程序之前进行此操作，以便 `other_router` 中的`路径操作`也能被包含进来。", "start_char": 18317, "end_char": 18393}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
{"id": "budget-independent-009", "category": "response-directly", "group_id": "new-response-directly", "question": "直接返回自建 Response 时，FastAPI 还会用 Pydantic 做数据转换吗？", "reference_answer": "不会，Response 会被直接传递，内容不再经过 Pydantic 数据转换或内容类型转换。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.117.1"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.117.1/advanced/response-directly.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/advanced/response-directly.md", "quote": "当你返回一个 `Response` 时，**FastAPI** 会直接传递它。", "start_char": 533, "end_char": 572}, {"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/advanced/response-directly.md", "quote": "**FastAPI** 不会用 Pydantic 模型做任何数据转换，不会将响应内容转换成任何类型，等等。", "start_char": 574, "end_char": 627}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
{"id": "budget-independent-010", "category": "response-directly", "group_id": "new-response-directly", "question": "手工构造 JSONResponse，传入含 datetime 的 Pydantic 对象前，可以使用哪个编码工具？", "reference_answer": "使用 jsonable_encoder 先把模型及 datetime 等转成兼容 JSON 的数据，再传入 JSONResponse。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.117.1"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.117.1/advanced/response-directly.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/advanced/response-directly.md", "quote": "例如，如果不首先将 Pydantic 模型转换为 `dict`，并将所有数据类型（如 `datetime`、`UUID` 等）转换为兼容 JSON 的类型，则不能将其放入JSONResponse中。", "start_char": 771, "end_char": 870}, {"source": "fastapi/0.117.1/advanced/response-directly.md", "quote": "对于这些情况，在将数据传递给响应之前，你可以使用 `jsonable_encoder` 来转换你的数据。", "start_char": 872, "end_char": 924}], "split": "test", "review_status": "human_verified", "authorship": "assistant_candidate_from_frozen_docs", "gate_selection_sha256": "d7bbaf536e42502ed2c81f682db4d149b0b0889f101c54d653be048b6c1edcb1", "candidate_revision": "20261109-r1", "reviewed_by": "JQH", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-09T10:08:57.649739+00:00"}
